%% First-class Strategies / shared logic and separate qualification.
flowchart TD
  Discovery[Discovery scans and routes] --> Eval[Strategies evaluation port]
  Research[Research / backtest isolated inputs] --> Eval
  Inputs[Features / deterministic regime / frozen evidence] --> Eval
  Eval --> Momentum[Momentum]
  Eval --> Breakout[Breakout]
  Eval --> Event[Event / Catalyst]
  Eval --> Mean[Mean Reversion]
  Eval --> Swing[Swing Trend]
  Momentum --> Candidate[Version / horizon / scope-bound candidate]
  Breakout --> Candidate
  Event --> Candidate
  Mean --> Candidate
  Swing --> Candidate
  Candidate --> Committee[Separate Committee evidence]
  Committee --> PM[Shared Portfolio Manager]
  PM --> Gate[Qualification + mode + risk + capability gates]
  Gate --> Order[Paper order workflow]
  Research --> Evidence[Offline evaluation evidence]
  Evidence --> Owner[Owner-approved scope qualification / activation]
  Owner --> Gate
